- Auth and context: `src/lib/api/auth.ts`, `src/lib/api/context.ts`, `src/lib/auth/server.ts`
- Ingress/proxy: `src/proxy.ts`, `src/lib/proxy/middleware-policy.ts`
- Supabase runtime/RLS: `supabase/runtime.ts`, `supabase/rls.ts`, `supabase/schema`, `supabase/migrations`
- Architecture enforcement: `tests/unit/architecture/import-boundaries.spec.ts`, `.oxlintrc.json`
- Existing architecture docs: `docs/architecture/*`, `docs/database/client-usage.md`, `supabase/AGENTS.md`
- Plan lifecycle: `src/features/plans/lifecycle/service.ts`, `types.ts`, `factory.ts`, `creation-pipeline.ts`
- Plan session/read model: `src/features/plans/session/plan-generation-session.ts`, `src/features/plans/session/usePlanGenerationSession.ts`, `src/features/plans/read-projection/service.ts`
- AI generation: `src/features/ai/orchestrator.ts`, `src/features/ai/providers/` (factory, openrouter, router, mock)
- Billing: `src/features/billing/*-quota-boundary.ts`, `metered-reservation.ts`, `metered-quota-boundary-core.ts`, `account-snapshot.ts`, `clerk-billing/` (plan-mapping, projection, reconciliation)
- Lesson content: `src/features/lesson-content/run-module-lesson-generation-work.ts`, `start-module-lesson-generation-workflow.ts`, `generate-module-lessons.ts`
- Notifications: `src/features/notifications/email/`, `src/lib/db/queries/email-*.ts`
- Jobs/workers: `src/app/api/internal/**`, `src/lib/api/internal/internal-worker-access.ts`, `src/lib/api/internal/maintenance-route.ts`, `src/features/jobs/`
- UI/client API: `src/app/(app)`, `src/app/(marketing)`, `src/app/(auth)`, `src/app/_shared/client-api.ts`, `src/components`, `src/hooks`
- Observability: `src/instrumentation.ts`, `sentry.server.config.ts`, `sentry.edge.config.ts`, `src/lib/logging/request-context.ts`, `src/lib/observability/metrics.ts`
